---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slide 06 - Jak opisywać system na diagramie"
  bgImage="/images/background-2.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.78), rgba(10,14,23,0.9))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="title">
        Sama nazwa to <span class="highlight">za mało</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede">Centralny prostokąt potrzebuje <strong>nazwy i 1–2 zdań</strong> o odpowiedzialności.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="compare">
      <article class="card card-bad">
        <header class="card-head">
          <span class="badge badge-bad"><i class="ti ti-x"></i> Źle</span>
          <span class="card-sub">sama nazwa — brak kontekstu</span>
        </header>

        <div class="box-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 460 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="sys-bad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#1d4ed8" stop-opacity="0.55"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1e3a8a" stop-opacity="0.55"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect x="40" y="50" width="380" height="120" rx="14" fill="url(#sys-bad)" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
            <text x="230" y="120" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f1f5f9" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="26" font-weight="800">Internet Banking System</text>
            <text x="230" y="148" text-anchor="middle" fill="#94a3b8" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="500" letter-spacing="3">[ SYSTEM ]</text>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <ul class="critique">
          <li><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> Co dokładnie robi ten system?</li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> Czy to portal, aplikacja mobilna, API?</li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> Nazwa jest myląca albo zbyt ogólna.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>vs</span>
      </div>

      <article class="card card-good">
        <header class="card-head">
          <span class="badge badge-good"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Dobrze</span>
          <span class="card-sub">nazwa + opis odpowiedzialności</span>
        </header>

        <div class="box-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 460 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="sys-good" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#1d4ed8"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1e3a8a"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect x="20" y="20" width="420" height="180" rx="14" fill="url(#sys-good)" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="3"/>
            <text x="230" y="68" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f1f5f9" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="800">Internet Banking System</text>
            <text x="230" y="92" text-anchor="middle" fill="#bfdbfe" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="500" letter-spacing="3">[ SYSTEM ]</text>
            <line x1="60" y1="110" x2="400" y2="110" stroke="rgba(191,219,254,0.25)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <foreignObject x="36" y="120" width="388" height="74">
              <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.4; color: #dbeafe; text-align: center;">
                Pozwala klientom banku sprawdzać saldo,
                wykonywać przelewy i zarządzać podstawowymi
                usługami bankowymi online.
              </div>
            </foreignObject>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <ul class="critique critique-good">
          <li><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Od razu wiadomo, do czego służy.</li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Czytelne dla biznesu i dla zespołu.</li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Granica odpowiedzialności jasno postawiona.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="footnote">
      <i class="ti ti-bookmark"></i>
      <strong>Nazwa + krótki opis odpowiedzialności</strong> — standard na diagramach C4.
    </p>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 1700px;
    padding: 48px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .header {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .level-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 7px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .level-chip i { font-size: 18px; }

  .title {
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lede strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .compare {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 28px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .card {
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 26px 28px 22px;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 0.4s forwards;
  }

  .card-bad {
    border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.32);
    background: rgba(60, 17, 22, 0.4);
  }

  .card-good {
    border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4);
    background: rgba(15, 39, 28, 0.45);
    animation-delay: 0.55s;
  }

  .card-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .badge i { font-size: 18px; }

  .badge-bad {
    color: #fca5a5;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.45);
  }

  .badge-good {
    color: #86efac;
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.45);
  }

  .card-sub {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #94a3b8;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }

  .box-wrapper {
    background: rgba(10, 14, 23, 0.45);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .box-wrapper svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 460px;
    display: block;
  }

  .critique {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .critique li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .critique li i {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: #fca5a5;
  }

  .critique-good li i {
    color: #86efac;
  }

  .divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.85s forwards;
  }

  .divider span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .footnote {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.3);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 1s forwards;
  }

  .footnote strong {
    color: #f1f5f9;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footnote i {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }
</style>
